      "message": "Thanks Chris for the suggestion.\n\nThe problem that we are facing ignoring the remote initiated disconnection (reason \u003d GATT_CONN_TERMINATE_PEER_USER), for adding to the background list is, for the use case, where when Buds is put to cradle, disconnects with reason \u003d GATT_CONN_TERMINATE_PEER_USER, subsequently when Buds is removed from the cradle, want the phone to connect back automatically.\n\nWe have debugged the issue to be related to the atest receiving a GATT open during a link disconnect.\n\nThe patch https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/packages/modules/Bluetooth/+/1963999/4 looks fine though.\n\nIs it possible to abandon this patch, will upload a new patch for this, but retain the patch https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/packages/modules/Bluetooth/+/1963999/4 for review and merge.\n\nThanks and Regards,\nPartha Sarathi",
